7.1 The Company warrants that:

(a) it has the necessary personnel, resources, and expertise to perform the Services in accordance with this Agreement;

(b) the Staff are legally entitled to work in Nigeria and hold all necessary permits and clearances;

(c) the Services shall be performed with reasonable care and skill, in accordance with industry standards; and

(d) it holds all necessary insurance policies, including public liability insurance, in respect of the Services.

